    "detailed_description": "<h1>Crossover characters are from these games:</h1><p>Atelier Marie Remake: The Alchemist of Salburg\r\nAtelier Sophie 2: The Alchemist of the Mysterious Dream\r\nAtelier Lydie &amp; Suelle: The Alchemists and the Mysterious Paintings DX\r\nAtelier Firis: The Alchemist and the Mysterious Journey DX\r\nAtelier Sophie: The Alchemist of the Mysterious Book DX\r\nAtelier Shallie: Alchemists of the Dusk Sea DX\r\nAtelier Escha &amp; Logy: Alchemists of the Dusk Sky DX\r\nAtelier Ayesha: The Alchemist of Dusk DX\r\nAtelier Meruru ~The Apprentice of Arland~ DX\r\nAtelier Totori ~The Adventurer of Arland~ DX\r\nAtelier Rorona ~The Alchemist of Arland~ DX</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Atelier 20th Anniversary Title\r\nAn Atelier town built together with legendary alchemists.\r\n\r\nThis title aims to combine the \u201cslice-of-life\u201d atmosphere of living in a town and collaborating with various characters and the exaltation that comes from successfully governing a town and expanding your world.\r\n\r\nThis title is designed to represent a new milestone in the evolution of the \u201cAtelier\u201d series, marking their 20th anniversary, and its theme is: Town-management Simulation x RPG.\r\n\r\nWe aim to provide our fans with an entirely new &quot;Atelier&quot; experience, while also inviting back many popular characters of past titles.",
    "about_the_game": "Atelier 20th Anniversary Title<br />\r\nAn Atelier town built together with legendary alchemists.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis title aims to combine the \u201cslice-of-life\u201d atmosphere of living in a town and collaborating with various characters and the exaltation that comes from successfully governing a town and expanding your world.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis title is designed to represent a new milestone in the evolution of the \u201cAtelier\u201d series, marking their 20th anniversary, and its theme is: Town-management Simulation x RPG.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe aim to provide our fans with an entirely new &quot;Atelier&quot; experience, while also inviting back many popular characters of past titles.",
    "short_description": "Atelier 20th Anniversary Title An Atelier town built together with legendary alchemists. This title aims to combine the \u201cslice-of-life\u201d atmosphere of living in a town and collaborating with various characters and the exaltation that comes from successfully governing a town and expanding your world.",
